{
 "uid": "services",
 "title": "Services — How Is One Service Doing?",
 "description": "Pick an area and a service; every panel is about that one service. The service list is read live from Kubernetes, so new services appear on their own. Only services that are supposed to be running (1+ copies) are listed.",
